delivery_package/

This directory is the packaging staging area for customer delivery.

Expected sub-structure (created by init.ps1 or manually):
  configs/          - RBAC policies, agent chain configs
  scripts/          - run_all.ps1, orchestrator.py, auto_rollback.ps1
  dashboards/       - metrics.md
  data/evals/       - test evaluation cases
  data/runs/        - output reports (latest_eval.json, rollback_report.json)
  .env.example      - environment template
  README.deliver.md - this file

Packaging command:
  Compress-Archive -Path delivery_package/* -DestinationPath openclaw-delivery-v1.0.zip
